  description: '2 Flip monsters

    Gains ATK equal to the combined original Levels
    of the "Subterror" monsters used for its Link Summon x 100. During your Main
    Phase: You can send 1 Flip monster from your Deck to the GY, and if you do, Special
    Summon 1 monster from your hand in face-down Defense Position to your zone this
    card points to. You can only use this effect of "Subterror Behemoth Fiendess"
    once per turn. Once per turn, if a monster this card points to is flipped face-up:
    Add 1 Flip monster from your Deck or GY to your hand.'
